{
  "bookId": "rewind-6",
  "id": "chapter-26",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3730001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "位于「废弃工厂」的流水线内，众手办与阿撒兹勒无声对峙，局面似乎一触即发。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你是阿撒兹勒！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "我们终于见面了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730004",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "被「天启」重重拦住，想冲破包围……却无济于事。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730005",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "即使冲出去，钢制结构的流水线……单凭借手办的力量去破坏，痴人说梦。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730006",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "可是优纪还在里面，我却……什么都做不了。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "放弃挣扎，拙劣的仿造者。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "啊——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "你、你在说什么！谁是“仿造者”！\n我可是背负着「修复破损瑕疵」的二手手办商店店主！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "你们的身体上，自制造出厂的那一刻起，就被印上了名为「FULI」的印记。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "越是挣扎，只会越暴露这印记的丑陋！这是他盗窃的罪证。如果不是因为他偷走主人的设计图……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "什么意思？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "我最心爱的部下们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "它们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "它们……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730016",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "还有它们！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "二十年前的「非常玩具工厂」，我曾亲眼见证主人在手稿上如何用笔将它们构思。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730018",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "如今被悉数打上「FULI」设计的标签并生产，你！胆敢嘴硬？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "这……撞设计，这、这也是很常见的事情嘛！\n何况这些玩具的复杂度，也完全不够高啊喂！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "偷盗者大可为自己的行径寻找百千种理由。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "睁大你们的双眼，仔细看清楚！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "这张手稿上的一切细节。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "非常……非常玩具公司？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "让我们亲眼见证，名为FULI的玩具公司。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3730026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "是如何把我主人的亲笔设计，一一占为己有！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-189",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
