      ],
      "title": "#3 剥落"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3760001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "喂，大笨蛋！你醒醒啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "紫色的涂料……是完全剥落了没错啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "这已经……完、完全是白模啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "这样子干干净净，不是更好吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "很好，亲手送葬的方式，非常好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760006",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "你……你说什么？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "你以为，那些玩具是着了魔，才肯乖乖接受这层紫色的涂装吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760008",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "流水线中，还有别的环节吗……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "只有先去除你们肮脏污浊的外表，才有资格接受这份神的洗礼。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "先死，后生！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "这些手办……在流水线内被涂上「紫色涂料」以前，就已经变成……没有生命的白模了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那么……优……优纪……可恶！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "有条不紊的悲叹着他人的命运的你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760014",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "不如就趁此机会，先好好审示自我的死像！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3760015",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "那也要看我的长枪，答不答应你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-192",
