      "title": "#5 玲"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3780001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "前辈……请问……那个……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "因为大家都在很努力的战斗……所以……请……请问……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "有关涂装的进程……进展得……还算顺利吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780004",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "虽然面部的修复比想象中困难了无数倍，但我是不会屈服的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780006",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "接下来，就请大家好好检验修复后的成果吧，锵锵锵锵——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "嘿嘿……欸嘿嘿……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "我是……一个傻子……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "那个……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "这……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "感觉哪里……看起来不对的样子……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "可恶可恶可恶，人家明明已经很用心的在做了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "那个……那个……涂料已经被用光了啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "巧妇难为无米之炊……是……是这么说没错吧！（逃……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "欸嘿嘿……你们看……天上，天上有大灰机……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "宝宝要把灰机打……嘿嘿……打下来……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "出现了！辕门射戟·超绝无双神威三式！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "好！好可怕的破坏力！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "欸？诶诶？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "居然只用简单的一击……就把如潮水般的大军给……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "那个……这种与战斗力不符合的设定究竟是怎么回事啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "打个大西瓜，宝宝吃瓜瓜……肚子咕咕咕，不要饿饱饱……欸嘿嘿……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不知该摆出怎样的表情……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "哦，对了，喂，吕布，既然你已经好了。不如来签一下名。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "这里吗？好的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780027",
          "sourceType": 12,
          "text": "组织：M. The 3rd Section\n编号：516747\n地址：FULI玩具公司4区A号货架\n描述：神威无双只爱貂蝉正是在下",
          "title": "身份卡 · 吕布",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780028",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "M. The 3rd Sect.",
          "text": "恭喜完成「吕布」的居住入册登记。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "真田先生，你也是参加实习生试炼的试炼者？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "是啊，昨天我本来正准备给这位吕布完成居住入册登记，谁知道突然冒出几个人把我们打晕抓了过来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "糟了，优纪还在流水线上！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780032",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "哦，你在找我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3780033",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "这……这是……优纪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
